@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Tamu" as Tamu
boundary "Landing Page" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Profiles" as DB

== Akses Landing Page ==

Tamu -> UI : Akses URL Landing Page
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/public/packages
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data paket & harga
activate DB
DB --> System : Daftar paket aktif
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data paket layanan
deactivate System
activate UI
UI -> UI : Render halaman\n(Hero, Paket, Testimoni)
UI --> Tamu : Tampilkan informasi\npaket & harga layanan
deactivate UI

@enduml
